; equality_penalty_overflow: EQUALITY doubles its penalty to build the
; quadratic coefficients (two_p = 2 * penalty). At i64::MAX that doubling
; leaves the range, so the expansion must raise instead of writing a
; wrapped coefficient into the model.

PUSH 2
BQMX r0

VECI r1
PUSH 0
VECPUSH r1
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r1

VECI r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r2

PUSH 0           ; target
PUSH 9223372036854775807        ; penalty
EQUALITY r0 r1 r2

HALT
